@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:8000
@accessToken = ACCESS_TOKEN
@refreshToken = REFRESH_TOKEN
@csrfToken = CSRF_TOKEN_FROM_COOKIE

### Account registration — create a user account by Djoser
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/users/
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "newplayer",
  "email": "newplayer@example.com",
  "password": "Example-Password-42"
}

### Login — obtain access and refresh tokens; response also sets auth cookies
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/jwt/create/
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "testuser",
  "password": "test-password"
}

### Refresh — explicit token form retained for API/manual verification
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/jwt/refresh/
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refresh": "{{refreshToken}}"
}

### Cookie refresh — browser form requires the CSRF header
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/jwt/refresh/
X-CSRFToken: {{csrfToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### Protected profile — Bearer JWT does not require CSRF
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/profile/
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Protected profile — missing access token -> 401
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/profile/

### Change password — revokes all current session families for the user
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/users/set-password/
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "current_password": "test-password",
  "new_password": "Example-New-Password-43"
}

### Request password reset — same response whether the account exists or not
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/users/reset-password/
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "newplayer@example.com"
}

### Confirm password reset — fill uid/token from the one-time e-mail link
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/users/reset-password-confirm/
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "uid": "RESET_UID",
  "token": "ONE_TIME_RESET_TOKEN",
  "new_password": "Example-Reset-Password-44"
}

### Logout — revokes the current refresh-token family
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/logout/
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refresh": "{{refreshToken}}"
}

### Refresh after logout — must not issue a new access token
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/jwt/refresh/
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refresh": "{{refreshToken}}"
}

### Throttling smoke check — manually repeat this request until 429
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/jwt/create/
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "rate-limit-probe",
  "password": "wrong-password"
}
